#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1323 expect=skipped domain=TS
#note "CORPUS-WIDE PIN of the CODELIST_TERMS empty->skip channel: with no '#library codelist-terms COUNTRY ...' declared, the resolved term list is empty, OperationExecutor yields LIBRARY_NOT_AVAILABLE and the rule SKIPs (mirrors Python's MissingDataError) - otherwise 'TSVAL not in $country_terms' would flag every populated FCNTRY row. Uses the invalid body's TS dataset (FCNTRY/Germany present) so the fixture is discriminating."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | TS | 1 | FCNTRY  | Germany
S1 | TS | 2 | FCNTRY  | USA
S1 | TS | 3 | FCNTRY  |
S1 | TS | 1 | SPONSOR | ACME PHARMA
